Case Study Section — THIS IS CRITICAL
Apple’s rule for case studies
Show results, not process noise.
Structure per case study
Client context (1 line)
Problem (1–2 lines)
Solution (1 line)
Outcome (metrics or concrete impact)
No screenshots unless they add meaning.